	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note> acceptabiles supra modum, ornatissime frater, 3. et 7. huius mensis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>datas, cum recusatione consilii malignantium <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentini</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Die "Antwort der Predigeren zu <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> uff des Papsts Laden in das Concilium zu <placeName ref="l1107">Trient</placeName>" vom 1. August 1546; s. dazu <ref target="file12577">Nr. 2530</ref>, Anm. 27.</note>, integras accepi, proque <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>cura et pietatis in nos ferventi studio tibi gratias ago immortales.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Plurimum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>profecto totam <placeName ref="l18">Augustam</placeName> tuus ceterorumque Helvetiorum<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> propensus in nos animus iuvat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dominus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>conservet etiam vos faustos et concordes, quemadmodum <persName ref="p8055">Blaurerus</persName> noster bonam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>unanimitatis vestrę spem mihi iniecit<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Anspielung auf die Meinungsverschiedenheit zwischen den protestantischen Stadtkantonen und den <placeName ref="l2453">Neun Orten</placeName>; s. zuletzt <ref target="file12580">Nr. 2533</ref> und Anm. 28. -Ein entsprechender Brief <persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> an <persName ref="p8354">Frölich</persName> ist nicht bekannt.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Nostri occupaverunt oppidum Rhain citra sanguinem<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Am 10. oder 11. August; s. <ref target="file12580">Nr. 2533</ref>, Anm. 16.</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nam etsi illud pręsidio <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>cesaris<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note>, nempe 500 militibus atque <placeName ref="l619">Bavarorum</placeName> 200 equitibus, custoditum sit, tamen <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ultro se nostris dedidit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nunc exercitus noster <placeName ref="l231">Ingolstadium</placeName> versus contendit,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Die <placeName ref="l1202">Schmalkaldener</placeName> begannen am 16. August mit der Belagerung <placeName ref="l231">Ingolstadts</placeName>, fanden aber bald einen Kompromiss mit der Stadt, um schon am 19. August über <placeName ref="l3008">Beilngries</placeName> und <placeName ref="l3009">Hemau</placeName> weiter nach <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName> gegen den Kaiser ziehen zu können; s. Zürich StA, A 177, Nr. 27 (<placeName ref="l257">Konstanzer</placeName> Rat an den <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Rat, 23. August <hi>1546); Herberger, Schertlin</hi> 137- 151; Nr. 2548,20-29; <bibl source="b581">Schüz, Donaufeldzug</bibl> 31f; <bibl source="b478">Paulus, Schertlin</bibl> 64.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quod forti pręsidio cęsaris firmatur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">An autem nostri<pb type="edition" next="316"/> civitatem eam, quę <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>totius <placeName ref="l619">Bavarię</placeName> munitissima est, oppugnaturi sint, adhuc nescitur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Cęsar, qui cum suis copiis ad <placeName ref="l276">Landshut</placeName> aliquantisper delituit, iam <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>redit<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Siehe Nr. 2533, Anm. 22.</note>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Habet enim pedicarios<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">=pedicatores; s. Thesaurus Linguae Latinae, Bd. Xii, Berlin/New York 1982-1997, Sp. 974f.</note> et zodomitas<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">= sodomitas.</note> 12000, in quos robur omne pon<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>it.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quidam comes<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Der kaiserliche Feldherr <persName ref="p7459">Maximilian von Egmont</persName>, Graf von <placeName ref="l2126">Büren</placeName>.</note>, gubernator <placeName ref="l734">Frisiorum</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p7459">Egmont</persName> war Statthalter von <placeName ref="l642">Friesland</placeName>.</note> magno cum exercitu<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Siehe dazu <ref target="file12559">Nr. 2512</ref>, Anm. 15.</note> iam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>approperat cęsari manus iuncturus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Spero autem nostros, qui ad <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l2459">Rhenum</placeName> illum expectant, ipsum aut remoraturos aut cum eo conflicturos.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Dominus donet nobis non iuxta meritum nostrum, sed pro sua gloria!</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Plura <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>propter accelerationem tabellarii<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Unbekannt.</note> non potui.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Abbas <placeName ref="l473">Sangallensis</placeName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p8179">Diethelm Blarer von Wartensee</persName>.</note> pecunias contra nos iamdudum atque etiam hoc anno <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>cęsari contribuit<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Siehe dazu schon <ref target="file12570">Nr. 2523</ref>,48-50. Auf der Tagsatzung zu <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> vom 9. August wurde dieser beschuldigt, dem Kaiser 10.000 Gulden für den Krieg beigesteuert zu haben; s. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1d 661 u.3.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Hoc pro certo mihi scriptum est, sed cui et quantum aut <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quo tempore dederit, hactenus experiri non potui.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Si fieri poterit, expis<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>cabor et tibi significabo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> totus noster est, vir ut iuvenis etate<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p8018">Haller</persName> (geb. am 18. Januar 1523) war damals 23 Jahre alt.</note> ita grandevus mente.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Dominus hunc servet communi huic reipublicę christianę!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>dominos consules<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><persName ref="p1419">Hans Haab</persName> und <persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>.</note>, symmistas et eruditos omnes, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> praecipue, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>cuius equam Heremitanam, imo monachorum turpitudinem,<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p8011">Gwalthers</persName> Gedicht "Prognosticon vel Chria Monachis Mariae Eremitanae oblata"; s. <ref target="file12576">Nr. 2529</ref>, Anm. 29.</note> divulgabo<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Ein entsprechender Druck konnte nicht ermittelt werden.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>17. augusti 1546.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p8354">Georgius Laetus</persName>, etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Exercitum habemus optime instructum <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>et copiosissimum<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Zur Truppenstärke der <placeName ref="l1202">Schmalkaldener</placeName> s. die Verweise in <ref target="file12580">Nr. 2533</ref>, Anm. 11.</note>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Hostem ad pugnam <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>provocamus, sed ipse remoram quęrit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Herrn <persName ref="p495">Henrichen Bullinger</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>vorgeern<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="21">Antistes.</note> der kilchen <placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>mynem lieben herrn und <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>brudern, ze hannden<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Der Brief wurde via <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> versandt; s. <ref target="file12593">Nr. 2546</ref>,33-35; <ref target="file12621">Nr. 2574</ref>,17f.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
